    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/uvekhen_ten_kavod" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n26.jpg">
        <tei:p>And therefore grant honour, O Lord, to Thy people, fame to those who fear Thee and praise to those who seek Thee and confidence to those who wait for Thee, joy to Thy <tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n28.jpg" n="17"/>land, happiness to Thy city and a rise of fortune to David Thy servant and an array of light to the son of Jesse Thine anointed speedily and in our days. </tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
